Placeholder so this directory exists in a fresh clone.

`pyproject.toml` force-includes `modelmri/static/app` into the wheel and
sdist; hatchling raises "Forced include not found" if the path is missing,
which breaks `uv sync` / `pip install -e .` before the frontend is built.

The real contents are produced by `cd frontend && npm run build` and are
gitignored.
